window.products.push({"id":1148008,"name":"SYMY Twin Bed Metal Bed Frame, Sturdy 9 Legs, Two Headboards and Metal Steel Support for Bedroom Living Room,White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F3xLdytuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"First of all, thank you very much for choosing our perfect home. This bed frame uses a sturdy and durable metal frame structure, combined with a beautifully lined headboard design, clean appearance and simple color scheme, which can be used with neutral and bold decoration. The sturdy bed frame, without any noise, can give you a good night's sleep, which is ideal for every family. Feature: product:197*91*95cm material:metal tube in coating printing Package Includes: A bed frame Package Size:102*28*13 cm Weight:18 KGS Mattress size: 190*90cm Notice: Manual measurement, there are some reasonable error Items may slightly different from photo in terms of color due to the lighting during photo shooting or the monitor's display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F3xLdytuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYMY","source_asin":"B085ZZ6JZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085ZZ6JZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085ZZ6JZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148009,"name":"VUDECO Charcuterie Board Set 12“ Cheese Board with 3 Serving Plates 3 Knives 3 Slake Labels and 2 Chalk Markers - Round Charcuterie Board Large Wooden","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nkoOfqcKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All-in-one Charcuterie Board Set - VUDECO wooden cheese board set includes 1 serving board, 3 cheese knives, 3 ceramic plates, 3 slake labels and 2 white chalk markers. Our 12\" round cutting board is large enough for meat and cheese at your parties. Besides, we offer not only 3 ceramic plates that hold on more food, but also chalk markers and natural slate labels that help your guests identify different types of cheese and charcuterie. Rotating Design - Our Cheese board are rotating design and includes 2 layers. There are enough spaces for ceramic plates on the top layer, and you can cut and place more food. The second layer is a slide-out storage tray which concealed 3 cheese knives and 3 slate labels with chalk markers. With rotating design, it can not only help your guests easily pick up cheese and meat but also add a touch of elegance to your party or family gathering. High Quality Material - Our charcuterie board are made of wood and the cutting surface is thick and sturdy enough for you to cut cheese or meat on it. In addition to the wood cheese board, our ceramic bowls and cutlery set are both made of high quality material and durable enough that can stand for diverse parties, birthdays, family gatherings, Christmas, or any other occasions. Easy to Clean - You can clean our round wood cutting board easily with mild detergent and sponge, then rinse it off with warm water and put it air dry. With the rotating design, the layers can be thoroughly cleaned and becomes an easy-storage round cheese platter after you put the layers back. Besides, you can also apply mineral oil to the wood to keep it shiny. Excellent Gift - VUDECO charcuterie board set is a nice gift choice for cheese lovers at housewarming, celebration party, birthday, family gathering, Christmas, Thanksgiving, or any other occasions. With our wood cheese board, just get some food and drinks, then you are ready for the party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nkoOfqcKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VUDECO","source_asin":"B09493S16W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09493S16W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09493S16W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148010,"name":"Over the River Signature 3oz Reed Diffuser by Yankee Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RKcdxdALL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy America's best loved fragrances for your home in decorative fashion! This attractive reed diffuser continuously delivers the same long lasting, true-to-life Yankee fragrance... watery green notes with hints of sage, amber and oak. Plus, the distinctive, hand decorated glass accents any décor with style. They're also the ideal gift for any occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31RKcdxdALL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B0057QY2NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057QY2NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057QY2NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
