window.products.push({"id":1148148,"name":"Santa Barbara Design Studio Diva Lolita Sexy Shooter Glass, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e5xAWx-uL._AC_SL1156_.jpg","description":"A curvy little shot glass with a hot design, distinctively painted and embellished to reflect its title. Makes a great addition to a gift basket or bag and is a special treat to find inside a stocking Christmas morning or for having the perfect shot glass for the birthday girl at the bar! Who comes to mind when you see the glass? Gift boxed and ready for giving or keeping. To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, they make what they love and love what they make. The one and only. Lolita, who took hold of her original idea for a fancier martini glass and expanded it to fit absolutely any person, male or female from wine connoisseur to beer enthusiast and everything in between. She took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed...that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. Lolita is THE original source for unique glassware designs. What is your moment? Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e5xAWx-uL._AC_SL1156_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B00J4MWCRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J4MWCRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J4MWCRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
