window.products.push({"id":1148316,"name":"WATINC 26 Pack DIY Burlap Banner Set include Letter Stencil, Design Swallowtail Flags for Kids and Adults, Handwriting Banner for Birthday and Indepen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915wwHYZ6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Material] Made of natural burlap, durable and reusable. The burlap banner is pre-assembled, no more assembly needed of you. The stencil letter is made of PET material. [Package Include] 1* blank burlap banner includes 26pcs swallowtail flags and each flag measures about 5.1*7.1inch. 26* letter stencils, each stencil measures about 4.0*4.3inch. [Let’s DIY] The flag is blank, you can draw and write on the flag. You can use our letter stencils to write nice words, also you can draw some cute patterns, such as flowers, hearts, stars, etc. Just put it flat, then fixed it. Paint it with spray/brush/chalk marker whatever you like to draw on the flag. The letter stencils can be used for painting on the banner, paper, wood and more. [Wide Application] Special handwriting decorations for birthday wedding graduation party, you can write the sentences or draw the patterns you like. The banner can be hanging on ceiling, wall, window, fireplace, tree branches, garden, etc. [WARM TIPS] The burlap banner is pre-strung, no more assembly needed of you. According to your actual needs, this banner can be cut.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915wwHYZ6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATINC","source_asin":"B08HH8XL9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HH8XL9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HH8XL9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
