window.products.push({"id":1148358,"name":"VEVOR Manual Wheatgrass Juicer Stainless Steel Hand Crank Wheatgrass Juicer Hand Wheatgrass Grinder with Suction Cup Base & Table-top Clamp Manual Jui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V3MOHB+WS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material & Extra Parts: Exquisitely crafted and designed, our manual wheatgrass juicer is an ideal kitchen helper, bringing you the fun of juicing. All the parts that come into contact with fruit or vegetable ingredients adopt food-grade 304 stainless steel, durable and sanitary. It comes with considerate & complete accessories, including a tamping rod, a cleaning brush, a juice-catching cup, and a set of parts for replacement (filter, axle sleeve, sealing ring each for one). Effortless To Get High Juice Yield: Our hand-crank wheatgrass grinder will keep the original flavors when juicing. The feed port with a 3.4\" (8.6 cm) diameter can hold more food ingredients. The stainless steel screw auger, formed in solid casting, can grind & squeeze more thoroughly. The juice outlet is smooth and free of clogging, and the 360-degree rotatable handle considerably serves the labor-saving operation. Besides, you can rotate the screw on the dregs outlet to adjust the fineness. Suction Cup Base & Tabletop Clamp: This hand wheatgrass juicer has two types of fixing methods. For the first, you can attach it to the flat surfaces (such as wooden, glass, marble, etc.) with its round suction cup base, measuring 4.7\" (12 cm) in diameter. Press down the knob on its side, and then it will be tightly fixed onto the desktop. For the other, you can clip it on the edge of your worktable with the aid of the table-top clamp and flexibly tighten or loosen it by turning the screw. Easy-to-clean Detachable Design: Unlike the electric ones, this manual extractor for fruits and vegetables calls attention to easy washing. All the parts are detachable (body, handle, parts inside, and screws for connection or adjustment), from the comfort of which you can clean them thoroughly with the brush offered and reassemble them in a breeze. Tip: The organic acids from the juice of fruits & vegetables would corrode the stainless steel surface. Please clean it in time after use. Multipurpose Hand Crank Juicer: As a good helper in your kitchen, well-designed yet simple-to-use, our hand-crank wheatgrass juicer adopts premium material and integrates two alternative fixing ways. It is suitable for extracting various fruits and vegetables, such as wheatgrass, ginger, celery, apple, grape, watermelon, pomegranate, etc. It can seal in the original flavor of the ingredients to the greatest extent and provide a relatively high juice yield at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V3MOHB+WS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0989TW6D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989TW6D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989TW6D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
