window.products.push({"id":1148360,"name":"Pet Memorial Wind Chimes Rainbow Bridge,36 Inch Large Wind Chimes Outdoor Deep Tone in Memory of Dog All Pets,Sympathy Wind Chimes Rainbow Bridge Pet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x+EaqJA6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐕 Pet Memorial Wind Chimes – Named “Rainbow Bridge Wind Chime” to honor our lovely pets. The pet memorial chime is painted with colorful waterproof paint.6 colors tubes symbolize the rainbow bridge connecting heaven and earth. Our friends at rainbow bridge - forever in our hearts. A unique pet memorial gift that brings grace & love to any garden or memorial space. 🐱 Rainbow Bridge Windchime for Loss of Pets- Pet memorial wind chime has a wonderful tone thanks to expert tuning. The sound is relaxing, deep tone and soft. It can calm down your depressed mood. Listen quietly, all of the calming and melodious sounds become a graceful music, like birds singing in the yard. You'll also remember the good times you had with your pet. ❤ Pet Wind Chime in Memory of Dog All Pets - The pet memorial wind chimes have a wonderful tone. It's not like other wind chimes that just make metallic sounds. The large wind chimes tuned relax, soothing, deep tone. Using this chime as a reminder that every time it rang and moved it is her(his) letting them know she(he) is near and watching over them always. 🌈 Remember Pet, “you left paw prints on our hearts ” – Gift box packaging with rainbow bridge poem card and greeting card. Beautiful pet memorial wind chime with the paw print \" We are now all together, Again and Forever, Across the rainbow bridge\". There’s an inscription on the heart wind-catcher reads “You left paw prints on our hearts”. And you can DIY stick a picture of your pet on the back of a paw print or leave what you want to say on the back of a heart. 🎶 Sympathy Wind Chimes Deep Tone for Garden Decor- The entire product itself is 36 inches from top to bottom. The chimes are a nice size. Not too small nor especially large - but just the right size to fit nicely in a garden and admire while remember the lovely times with your fur family. Overall, this will make a beautiful memorial for your pet, highly-recommended. Lovely gift for those who've lost their furry friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x+EaqJA6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aimiwial","source_asin":"B07RL6K1LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RL6K1LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RL6K1LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
