window.products.push({"id":1148366,"name":"SainSonic Non-Contact Instant-Read Laser IR Themometer Gun Wide Temperature Range (Yellow-Grey(-58F to 1202F))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JsfhiQPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The SainSonic SS5650 Thermometer Gun does everything from verifying the temperature in your AC system in the car or home to help electricians find an overcharge in electrical systems. Advances in optics make this technology more accurate and cost-effective. Automotive, HVAC, electrical, industrial or home - this versatile tool can perform anywhere. Attributes & Specifications * Temperature Range: -50C to 650C (-58F to 1202F)  * Accuracy: ±2C  * Distance To Measurement Spot Ratio: 12:1  * Unit of Measurement: Celcius or Fahrenheit  * Display: Easy to read large LCD display  * Battery Details: 9V battery  * Safety Warning: Be sure to check battery power level before each use. Application Instantly measure temperatures from a distance without contact. Ideal tool for measuring temperatures in hard to reach or dangerous to access places.   Please Visit Sain Store for more thermometers in different measuring range. For further assistance, please feel free to contact our customer service. We would be more than happy to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JsfhiQPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLTED","source_asin":"B00BQ4ROPI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BQ4ROPI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BQ4ROPI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148367,"name":"Elechelf Electric Gooseneck Kettle, 0.8L Pour-Over Coffee Kettle, Variable Temperature Control Tea Kettle, Auto Shut off & Boil-Dry Protection, 1000W ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715j-8423UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PRECISE TEMP CONTROL, 6 BREW MODES, 2 HOURS KEEP TEMP】 With this pretty gooseneck electric kettle with precise to-the-degree temperature control, you can set the temp you need and it can keep that temperature up to 2 hours. This electric kettle with 6 brew modes: Boil/Black, Coffee, Oolong, Green/White, Milk powder. You can also adjust the temperature in units of 1 °F by press the knob and start to rotating, meeting nearly all the brewing needs in life. 【STAINLESS STEEL, RUST-PROOF, BPA-FREE】 Food-grade SUS 304 stainless steel interior ensures the pure taste, will not rust and no plastic smell, keeps perfect taste of the coffee and tea or other brewing drinks. 【GOOSENECK SPOUT, SLOW & STEADY FLOW】 The electric kettle with slender gooseneck spout design, makes it easier to control the water flow speed and direction from different pouring angles to ensure precise pouring and steady water flow. 【WORKS QUIETLY, LEAK-PROOF】 This gooseneck pot adopts upgraded technology, it is super silent while boiling water. it will not disturb your family when you wake up early to make coffee. The spout connection adopts a double-layer welding process, so there is no need to worry about leaking. 【FAST BOILING, SAFE PROTECTION】This electric kettle only takes a few minutes to boil water. Besides, this gooseneck pot protects from overheating and dry-burning. When danger is predicted, it will automatically cut off the power, so you don’t need to worry about safety problem while using this electric kettle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715j-8423UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elechelf","source_asin":"B0B55T7SQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B55T7SQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B55T7SQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
