window.products.push({"id":1148385,"name":"Electric Milk Frother, 11.8oz/350ml Large Capacity Milk Frother and Steamer for Latte Coffee, Cappuccino, Latte, Milk Warmer with Two Whisks for Hot&C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jMXZGPwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SIMPLE OPERATION WITH ONE BUTTON】Superior multi-function electric milk frother and steamer provides you with warm milk, hot dense/airy foam, you can switch the 3 modes with one button attached on the handle, which makes the operation more ergonomic and convenient, Perfect for homemade cappuccino, latte, macchiato, hot milk and more 【DIY SPECIALTY COFFEE AT HOME】Electric milk frother has a maximum capacity that can froth 4.73oz/160ml milk (about four cups), heating up to 11.18oz/350ml of milk. this milk steamer frother can create smooth normal milk foam in 1min, creamy hot milk foam in 1-2mins, and heat up the milk in just 2-3mins 【SMOOTH SILKY MILK FOAM】The electric coffee frother quickly produces dense milk foam for your coffee, you can make barista-level coffee at home with ease. it's recommended to use the whole milk to froth(milk fat content>3% ) Using fresh, cold milk (ideally around 50 °F/10 °C) will result in a more delicate foam 【EASY TO CLEAN】The design of the split body and inside non-stick coating is easy to clean. Clean it with water and a gift brush, and wipe it with a cloth. (Note: Do not directly rinse the outside of the milk frother wif water; Do not put in the dishwasher for cleaning) 【SUPERIOR DESIGN】with sound-absorbing design, the milk frother produces almost little noise after covering the lid, and it will automatically turn off when the job is done. The angled spout makes it easy for pouring, and convenient for creating latte art before drinking 【SAFETY DURABLE & STYLISH DESIGN】Passed FDA and FCC certificates, the food-grade, thickened insulated stainless steel non-stick inner coating is durable, the milk steamer frother will automatically switch off when the milk or foam is done for built-in temperature control chip, to prevent your milk from burnt or over-frothed. the smooth layer of the exterior makes the coffee foaming maker more stylish, and matches your kitchen 【WARM TIPS】(1) In order to improve the use effect of the milk frothing machine, when you choose the frothing function, please make sure the milk is below the frothing milk MAX line (not the top heating MAX line) to prevent overflow. (2) Please use full-fat milk(Fat Content>3%), other milk products such as skim milk, low-fat milk, plant milk, yogurt, or nut milk will not froth properly. (3) We supply 1-year unconditional quality warranty and lifetime service, any questions, please e-mail us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jMXZGPwPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEENCE","source_asin":"B09TKR8ZKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKR8ZKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKR8ZKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
