window.products.push({"id":1148588,"name":"Mind Reader Pop/Soda Can Dispenser Storage Organizer Bin for Kitchen Pantry, Countertops, Cabinets, Refrigerator 2 Pack , Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZqLPuLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your refrigerator neat and organized with the Mind Reader Stackable Acrylic Pop/Soda Can Dispenser Bin. BEVERAGE ORGANIZER The Mind Reader soda can organizer is a convenient, space-saving organizer for your refrigerator, pantry, or kitchen cabinet that allows you to stack cans of soda or pop, iced tea, beer, and more in a compact design. STACKABLE DESIGN This soda can organizer is stackable so you can stack several to create more storage space for beverages in your refrigerator, storage room, or wherever you need to store cans of your favorite drinks. DURABLE MATERIAL Made from durable, clear acrylic, this organizer is sturdy and designed to last, The clear design makes it easy to see which beverage can you're grabbing out of the refrigerator. FOOD SAFE The acrylic material is food safe, so it is safe to use this organizer to store food items as well or to place foods next to the organizer in your refrigerator. MULTI-PURPOSE Use it to store more than soda cans. It can also be used to store small bottles of water and sports drinks, as well as fruits, vegetables, blocks of cheese, small food storage containers, and more. SPACE SAVING DESIGN Get several of these storage bins to maximize storage space anywhere you need it, including in the kitchen, pantry, garage, cabinets, refrigerator, or freezer. AMPLE STORAGE FOR BEVERAGES The bin is designed to store an ample amount of cans of soda and pop. SLEEK AND STYLISH CLEAR ACRYLIC The clear bin offers a sleek and stylish look for your refrigerator or any space you use it to organize, while creating additional storage space. Shop the Mind Reader clear stackable soda can organizer bin and other high-quality products from the Mind Reader collection for all of your storage and organizational solutions for the home, the office, and beyond.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZqLPuLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B073WQBQSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WQBQSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073WQBQSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
