window.products.push({"id":1148624,"name":"Waterford Evolution Reef Waters 8-Inch Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GKVS9MNQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Waterford's Evolution collection of fine art glass, infused with exotic color patterns, continues to \"evolve\" with new pieces in edgy, yet classical form. The green and blue coloring of this collection evokes a feeling of being near a tranquil sea on a flawless summer day. Even the most frantic office or busy home can become a personal sanctuary. Geometric lines and swirling shades also accent the line. Amazon.com A swirl of green accents the cool blue that saturates Waterford's stunning Reef Waters vase. The vase tapers dramatically to a height of eight inches from a narrow but dense and stable base. Linear vertical cuts, more on one side than the other, add visual intensity and a ribbed texture that provides a sure grip when picking up the heavy piece. Mouth-blown by skilled glassworkers in Poland, the contemporary vase makes a striking centerpiece or displays a bouquet of flowers. Evolution, inspired by the forms and colors of nature, is Waterford's most avante garde collection. Encompassing vases, bowls, candle votives, and more, the art glass collection bursts with sophisticated color combinations, asymmetrical shapes, and a lively aesthetic. Packaged in a handsome Waterford logo box, each Evolution piece makes a superb special occasion or corporate gift. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GKVS9MNQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B000EUHFFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EUHFFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EUHFFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148625,"name":"Terra Cotta Cazuela Dish, Round - 15 Inch / 24 cups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K8qZ2HuAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A 15-inch diameter, 3 inch deep terra cotta cazuela dish is a good size to cook garlic shrimp, fideua and all kinds of other paella dishes and other traditional dishes such as fabada for a large group. Terra cotta is basic clay, low fired with an interior glaze. Our premium cazuelas are unique in that they are made by potters following the traditional Roman formula of mixing tiny pebbles into the clay which strengthens the dish and increases its heat retention. The handles are applied by hand. La Tienda is the only source of this kind of cazuela in America. The glaze on the cazuela is perfectly safe for all applications -- it contains no lead. We provide directions for a simple seasoning (essentially soaking in water for a few hours) which renders the cazuela good for stovetop, oven or microwave. When cooking with terra cotta, the key is to increase heat gradually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K8qZ2HuAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peregrino","source_asin":"B0030F24SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0030F24SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0030F24SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
