window.products.push({"id":1148635,"name":"Rikki Knight Autumn Apples in Wood Bucket Design Square Fridge Magnet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l6mDbfyaL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","description":"The autumn apples in wood bucket design square fridge magnet is beautiful for decorating your fridge or any other magnetic surface. This Masonite magnet can also be a great gift for your family and friends to commemorate each holiday or special occasion. This magnet measures 2.25\" X 2.25\". As these magnet are manufactured by Rikki knight you can be assured that this magnet will be a unique piece to your collection. This Rikki knight autumn apples in wood bucket could be an ideal gift for all occasion! disclaimer: all images are printed directly into the material - the texture of the image will always be a flat surface. Any images that appears to be 3d, textured, or glittery are flat printed images and are proudly printed in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l6mDbfyaL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rikki Knight","source_asin":"B00CVXDO7U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CVXDO7U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CVXDO7U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148636,"name":"MARTHA STEWART Impasto Wall Art Living Room Landscape Print Double Mat Canvas Home Accent Modern Bathroom Decoration, Ready to Hang Poster Painting fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lCJQ2MNdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a nature-inspired touch to your home decor with the Martha Stewart Impasto Landscape Framed Glass Wall Art Double Matte. A lush landscape is accented by a double matte and displayed under glass, creating a charming picturesque look. The coordinating frame complements the nature-inspired print, while two D-rings on the back make the framed wall art easy to hang. Part of the Martha Stewart Urban Contemporary Collection, this framed glass wall art adds a serene, natural touch to your living room or home office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lCJQ2MNdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B082YJP74V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YJP74V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YJP74V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148637,"name":"2 Intex Plunger Valve Assemblies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cs3aw-8QL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","description":"NEW Intex Plunger Valves are a must for running an efficient pool. They easily stop the flow of water allowing you to conduct simple pool maintenance. With the Intex Pool Plunger Valves you can change hoses and filter medium without any hassles. Stop wasting time and precious water and replace your plungers today. Includes: (2) Intex Pool Plunger Valve Assemblies Requires an Intex Pool with 1.5\" hose fittings or Intex Hose Adapter \"B\" to work properly Replace your old Intex plunger valves or upgrade to the Intex Plunger Valve system, makes changing hoses and pumps a breeze Works with the Intex 1500, 2500, 4000 gallon per hour filtration pumps, Sand Filters as well as the Intex Saltwater Chlorinator and Intex Chlorinator Pump Combo Units This product is included with New Intex Cartridge Filter Models (635 & 633), Chlorinator Filter Pump Combos and Sand Filters","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cs3aw-8QL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intex","source_asin":"B00KYSMZR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KYSMZR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KYSMZR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148638,"name":"Handmade Leather Journal with Parchment Paper, Clasp & Polished Stone (10\"x7\") Pendragon Series By Viatori","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eOaYjckHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Father of King Arthur and a fabled warrior king, Uther Pendgragon is lauded as one of the great, ancient kings of the British Isles. Tales of his ascent to the throne and his future success as king are also tied to the mystical origins of his surname and his association with the wizard, Merlin. It is with the rugged valor, and supernatural strength of Uther Pendragon that this journal was designed. Using sturdy and unadorned antique leather held by two antiqued brass clasps, this journal is adorned with a polished stone on its cover reminiscent of the the dragon-shaped comet he saw that marked his rise to power. Filled with 96 leafs of hand-sewn parchment paper, this beautiful journal will take you back to times of chivalry and sorcery as you record your life's lore. A true conversation piece, this genuine leather journal will provide both excellent visual appeal and extraordinary writing, sketching, and note-taking experiences. The texture and smell of parchment paper creates a unique and rich writing experience that will endure the test of time. And the look and feel of the hand crafted antique leather will only improve with time and use. Please note that because these journals are made of genuine leather, their color may vary slightly from the images in this listing. This ensures that each Viatori journal will be a one-of-a-kind keepsake. Anticipate a long life for this journal even after you have filled its pages with your own tales, artwork, and history. Meaning \"Traveler\" in Latin, Viatori journals are crafted with your journeying in mind. Designed with old-world care, and embodying functional and creative elements from ages long past, we hope that our journals will help you capture and remember your wanderings with a little flair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eOaYjckHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viatori","source_asin":"B00IUBI5WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IUBI5WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IUBI5WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
