window.products.push({"id":1148750,"name":"Tezzorio 3/4 Quart Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Mixing Bowl, (0.75 qt.) 22 Gauge (0.8 Mm) Flat Base Bowl with Curved lip, Heavyweight Mixing Bowls/Prep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31A0mS+71YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mix, toss, and prep like a pro! It is a must to have a stainless steel mixing bowl when baking or kitchen prepping for your multiple dishes. Discover this timeless classic that serves a vast assortment of purposes in food preparation. This high-rimmed heavy duty bowl can help users perform a variety of kitchen duties, from cracking eggs to mixing batter-you'll definitely want more than one. The mixing bowl is made of high-quality 22 gauge and 0.8 mm thick stainless steel that resists scratches and bumps and provides a shiny finish that lasts and lasts. Unlike wood or plastic, stainless steel does not absorb bacteria or odors ensuring food tastes fresh and crisp every single time. The bowl is refrigerator and freezer safe which makes it ideal for submerged marinating of meat, prepping meats or preparing salads for later. Wash the bowl easily in the dishwasher or wash them by hand. Our bowl was designed to make meals preparing a breeze. A wide rolled rim ensures a seamless pour every time with fewer spills when pouring batters. It allows you to have a sturdy grip every time when handling the bowl. This heavy duty bowl features a flat bottom which is especially convenient for mixing and beating. From mixing, tossing, and whisking to prepping and serving; this bowl is sure to be a kitchen staple.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31A0mS+71YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B09N2LF4JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N2LF4JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N2LF4JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
