window.products.push({"id":1148757,"name":"Maverton Whisky carafe + 6 glasses with engraving - 23 fl oz. classical spirits decanter for man - Elegant whisky set for him - For Birthday - Persona","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hk4sSc6HL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"🎁 STYLISH WHISKY SET: The eye catching, engravable whiskey set includes a 23 oz decanter in a classical style and 6 elegant 10 oz whisky tumblers shaped to enhance the experience of drinking and nosing the golden-brown liquor. Its unique design impresses with a simple cut and high-quality workmanship. This sophisticated and stylish barware will surely add a touch of luxury to your home and turn your bar into an elegant and classy space. It's perfect for whiskey, scotch, bourbon or cognac. 🎈 FOR MEN: The whiskey set is a great gift idea for men appreciative of the taste and aroma of high-quality spirits. It is an amazing present for your husband, fiance, male friend, father, brother, grandpa or uncle - simply for a real whiskey connoisseur. The whiskey set is perfect as an unforgettable gift, especially for birthday, graduation, bachelor party, wedding as well as for a Father's Day, Valentine's Day or Christmas. 🔬 PROFESSIONAL ENGRAVING: To give an individual character to the set, you can personalize it with your desired text. To add your request, please use the option \"Customize now\" in the top right corner of the page. Be inspired by our original ideas of personalization suitable for all occasions! 💎 ELEGANCE: The whiskey carafe and the 6 whiskey glasses included in the set amuse with their simple, yet sophisticated design. Its attractive aesthetics and high-quality workmanship will deliver remarkable delights to its users. The classic glass structure emphasizes simplicity and elegance of the whiskey set and personal engraving makes it unique, but a very practical gift to be enjoyed for a long time! 📝 SPECIFICATION: A decanter set with 6 glasses made of high quality glass is a fabulous gift idea that will definitely hit with everybody. An elegant addition to every dining table and a home bar. It can serve as a scotch, wine, whiskey, vodka and any type of liquor holder. A decanter is equipped with a glass closure which preserves the perfect taste and smell of the beverage for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Hk4sSc6HL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverton","source_asin":"B09RMHRKCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RMHRKCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RMHRKCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148758,"name":"Seda France Room Mists 6 Oz,Epices de Saison","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/211ZmmOhGxL._AC_.jpg","description":"There is a warm, inviting feeling that goes along with the start of fall, as leaves begin to turn and there's just enough of a nip in the air to light the season's first crackling fire. Epices de Saison embodies that special, all-too-brief time of the year with a spicy fragrance that tantalizes like a cup of hot buttered rum, including the scent of ground ginger, cinnamon and rich brown sugar. Create an instant atmosphere anywhere in your home with Seda France room mists – now in a gold aerosol can. Easy to use and no messy nozzles. These 6-ounce sprays are available in some of our bestselling Classic Toile fragrances and are perfect as gifts. 6 oz. spray Ground ginger, cinnamon, brown sugar","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/211ZmmOhGxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seda France","source_asin":"B00OM9ZVVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OM9ZVVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OM9ZVVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148759,"name":"BAWA Christmas Countdown Calendar Advent Calendar with 22 Charms, 2 Bracelet DIY Gifts for Girl Kids Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718DMiQY1xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎁This advent calendar is a fun, festive way for your little ones to count down the days throughout Advent until Christmas Day. 🎅Unique Christmas Countdown Advent Calendar, Unique set with Gift Box comes with 22 charms(Charms include a snowman, candy cane, reindeer, birds, snowflake and more.) and 2 bracelet 🎅Fun Christmas Countdown Calendar - From Dec 1 to Christmas, everyday has a special number and each number is a different jewelry gift. From Dec 1 open first Window: a nice Bracelet, continue to open window 2,3,4….. , coming a different and special charms everyday. 🎅A perfect Christmas Gift - Great festive gift for your daughter, granddaughter, niece, girlfriend, mother, aunt, grandmother, Teen Girls/Girl or a friend! This is going to be so much fun for her to open every day. 🎅 The jewelry is Cadmium free, hypoallergenic. Promotes beauty, health, good luck, and healing. ALSO a nice way to get some non candy/snacks options for childrens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718DMiQY1xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAWA","source_asin":"B08K3FLFWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K3FLFWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K3FLFWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1148760,"name":"Viking Stainless Gray Hand Blender","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oo-amHOOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet your new sous chef. The Viking professional hand blender makes quick work of everything from soups to smoothies to coffee beans with a professional-grade 300-watt motor. And thanks to ergonomic design and heavy-duty stainless steel standard attachments, it looks good doing it too. With this powerful hand blender from Viking, you get a professional grade 300 watt motor that provides powerful stability and smooth processing. Heavy duty Viking design incorporates ergonomic non slip grip handle. Rubberized non slip grip allows you to grasp the unit without it slipping during processing. Two speed pulse control offers flexible performance and automatic safety shut off. The units shuts off when touch is lost from the power buttons (high and low speed). Standard accessories include stainless steel blending attachment, stainless steel whisk attachment, and 35 ounce mixing cup with lid. Five foot long power cord for mobility in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oo-amHOOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Range","source_asin":"B00190W2K6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00190W2K6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00190W2K6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
