window.products.push({"id":1148923,"name":"Lily's Home Unbreakable Whiskey Tumblers, Made of Shatterproof Tritan Plastic and Ideal for Indoor and Outdoor Use, Reusable (10oz each, Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TgqADq4QL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"GREAT FOR PARTIES: No longer serve your guests with unattractive plastic. Shatterproof glasses are both elegant and long-lasting. The Unbreakable Whiskey Tumblers from Lily's Home comes with a set of four cups, and each holds up to 10 ounces of your favorite whiskey and other beverages. UNBREAKABLE ACRYLIC GLASSES: Each glass is made with the incredibly sturdy and BPA-free Tritan material. Tritan is crystal clear and looks just like glass, yet won’t shatter even if dropped outdoors. Glasses are approximately 3.5\" in diameter at the top and stands 3.6\" tall. KEEP THE BRILLIANT SHINE: The Unbreakable Tritan drinkware from Lily's Home is dishwasher safe. These fantastic glasses must be put on the top rack only and are not suitable for a heated cycle, or they can be hand washed gently without harsh abrasive detergents or scouring pads to keep them looking their best. A PERFECT GIFT IDEA: Lily's Home makes a wide array of products for every home and garden lover. Whether you're looking for a perfect gift to spruce up your friend's garden, or if you need a housewarming present, Lily's Home has something for everyone! MAKE A HOUSE A HOME: Lily’s Home offers beautifully designed clocks, dishware, garden decorations, and more to add a touch of style to any home. Whether you’re looking for a statement piece for your living room or looking for a way to add more color to your garden, Lily’s Home has just what you’re looking for!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TgqADq4QL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lily's Home","source_asin":"B01MRKY5EM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1148923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRKY5EM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRKY5EM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
